{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:57 2026-10-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:57 2026-10-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:57 2026-10-06 HKT</p><p>旺角奶路臣街近廣東道一樓宇，今日（10月6日）下午5時半左右，天台懷疑有雜物燒著而起火。現場火光熊熊，衝天濃煙滾滾，多人報案求助。消防接報趕至，動用一喉一煙帽隊灌救。起火原因仍待調查。</p><img alt=\"起火天台烈焰衝天。Threads：mandy.lau.75873\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0bd9cab6c4d5a479b70550dbe0d47435/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-06-18h07m17s536.png\"/><img alt=\"消防拖喉灌救。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/be033e56369af51edf40077016ef0e19/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_08_06_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"火警疑涉燒著天台雜物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b08a314006d3c67f1a3191555ebe6699/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_08_05_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為旺角奶路臣街近廣東道一樓宇。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dc26d3e1a6efe55167cb5eeb9ce074c7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_17_54_06.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"火光熊熊，濃煙衝天。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9df3264502b1748fa4f679a2889e4cef/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_17_54_07.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"濃煙離遠清晰可見。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/647b25c3c6a09d9d02777fa3e5445632/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_17_54_05.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T10:20:52.359200+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}